WEBVTT

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.110
Mother... Ding Lan?

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.900
Master!

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.300
Did the ghosts appear in your dream again?

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:23.610
Why not consult the 
Raven Consort about it?

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.380
It's fine. Don't tell her.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.680
But at this rate, you'll ruin your health.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:30.500
Qing.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.980
I said it's fine.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.500
I'm sorry.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.770
<i>Deep in the inner palace,</i>

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.380
<i>there lives a consort 
known as the Raven Consort.</i>

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:53.470
<i>She holds a special position. 
Despite her title of consort,</i>

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.280
<i>she does not perform nighttime duties.</i>

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.720
<i>Though she lives in the inner palace,</i>

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:02.690
<i>she has no contact with the emperor.</i>

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:06.410
<i>It is said that she can use 
mysterious arts...</i>

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:10.460
Will His Majesty come again tonight?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:13.340
<b>Episode 5 
Confidant</b>

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:11.550
There's no need.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:13.920
There you go again.

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:16.820
And yet, you're impatiently waiting for him.

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:18.510
Listen to me, Jiu-jiu.

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.420
I am a consort who does not 
perform nighttime duties.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:23.180
Yes, I know that.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.060
Well, what a coincidence.

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.320
He's arrived, Your Highness.

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:35.320
What do you want today?

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:42.580
You think all you need to do 
is bring food, don't you?

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.330
Do you not want it?

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:48.170
If I didn't want it, I'd have 
thrown you out by now.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.840
I'm glad you like them.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:54.130
I said nothing of the sort.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:57.130
I came today because I have a request.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.320
Apparently, the inner palace is haunted.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.900
Yes, I'm tired of hearing about that.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:06.170
They say the ghost has silver hair.

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:11.940
Are you aware there's a willow tree 
south of Huaniang's palace?

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:16.510
The ghost appears nightly beneath
 the tree while it is in bloom,

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:19.180
and ceases to appear once
 the tree produces down.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:23.330
Is the ghost a man or a woman?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.280
I don't know. Why?

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:28.210
I thought it might be Luan Bingyue.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:32.330
I see. Luan Bingyue, huh?

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.340
Is there something you know?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.890
He was the grandson of Emperor Luan,

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:42.010
a maverick who distanced himself 
from rule and was skilled in sorcery.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:47.100
His master and foster father was
 a sorcerer named Feng Yixing.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.140
He was fostered by a sorcerer?

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:53.130
It's unclear why, but his 
master is still alive.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.520
I'm currently looking into the matter.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.780
I'll let you know as soon 
as I learn anything.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:02.290
Meanwhile, I'd like you to handle 
the ghost haunting the willow tree.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:04.530
I'll consider it.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:06.670
It has just begun blooming.

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:09.440
The ghost should be appearing soon.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.740
Are you familiar with Yeyoushen?

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:18.850
The god who kidnaps people 
under cover of night?

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:19.670
Yes.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.430
Yeyoushen despises bright lights.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:28.060
That's why the inner palace and red-light 
district are kept so well illuminated.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.440
The red-light district 
should be unknown to you.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.190
I hear stories.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:37.450
It's bright outside in the red-light district, 
but not many flames are kept indoors.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.420
To prevent accidental fires?

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.080
No.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.450
It's to prevent people's faces 
from being seen clearly.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.320
They'd look boorish in bright light

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:48.950
that would fail to conceal 
their thick makeup and wrinkles.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:50.550
You seem to know it well.

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:54.350
Raven Consort, cease your useless riddles.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:56.990
Don't you think you're being rude?

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:00.510
It's fine. I've learned something new.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.940
Yeyoushen sometimes 
mingles among the people.

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:06.580
He could be right by your side.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.920
You should be careful.

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:10.140
I see. Then I shall.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.140
I'm not joking.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.620
I never thought you were.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.250
You wouldn't threaten someone as a joke,

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.630
and you don't say things to hurt others.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:24.540
I believe your words can be trusted.

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:27.950
I shall return.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.730
I keep telling you not to come back!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.750
Master.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.090
I simply tripped.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:45.510
Shall I stay by your side during the night?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.880
That's not necessary.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:50.600
Neither my mother nor Ding Lan
 do anything to harm me.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.620
Oh, it's you.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:13.120
Xing-xing was making a racket, 
so I was wondering who had come.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.620
What do you want?

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:18.630
I...

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Don't tell her.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:27.380
I know you. You must've come for help 
with something concerning him.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:31.380
No, I'm here to warn you.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:32.390
Warn me?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.610
As a survivor of the previous dynasty,

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:38.770
you will someday become 
trouble for my master.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:43.900
You should know that very well already.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:52.910
Before that time comes, you should 
mend both your words and ways.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:56.540
Mind your language around him, and
 treat him with the utmost courtesy.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.040
What if I say I cannot?

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:04.090
Don't you understand that I'm telling you 
you're in no position to say that?

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.260
You came here in the middle 
of the night just to tell me that?

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.980
You're an unpleasant man.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:14.140
I feel the same way about you.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.640
Isn't that a bit too blunt?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:20.260
You're not a consort according to the law,

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:22.650
and your name isn't even on 
the inner palace's register.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.600
The Raven Consort is something 
other than a consort,

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.890
so I find it unnecessary to demonstrate

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:31.660
the same courtesy I would 
show to other consorts.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.800
When you called me unpleasant,

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.050
did you think I would not respond in kind?

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.250
Is it because I'm a eunuch?

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:45.480
Excuse me.

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:07.430
What are you researching?

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:10.320
Do you remember our visit to Xue Yuyong?

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:14.270
He said that because the ghosts 
haunting Yandi were exorcised,

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:19.200
the Raven Consort and her mysterious arts 
could no longer be used carelessly.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:23.090
But that doesn't explain 
her forced solitude.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.900
I thought there might be more secrets.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:29.040
You're researching the Raven Consort again?

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.430
I'm curious.

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:32.970
Who exactly is the Raven Consort?

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:36.790
Sir, I've come to make my report.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:37.720
Dan Hai.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.890
Have you learned anything 
concerning the sorcerer?

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:45.730
I heard several rumors about 
a possible sorcerer west of the city.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:46.820
Where is he?

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:51.240
Because there were numerous sorcerers 
chased out of the city at the time,

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.990
I have yet to determine that.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.740
It will take some time.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.350
Fine. Continue your search.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:07:59.030
Yes, sir.

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:08.530
Master, I shall also look into 
the matter concerning the sorcerer.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:09.250
What?

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:12.360
We've been dealing with 
too much trouble recently.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:16.650
I'd like to remove the source of 
the problem as soon as possible.

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:19.070
Still, there's no need for you to go.

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:20.890
Would you permit it anyway?

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:23.640
Fine.

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:25.520
Thank you.

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.100
But don't push yourself too hard.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.130
That's not Bingyue. Who is she?

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.380
An agate pendant?

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:57.780
Yes. The willow ghost had 
one hanging from her sash.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.390
Does that sound familiar?

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.580
I've seen one before at the 
Ningguang Hall storehouse.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:05.920
If we check the records, we should be 
able to figure out whose it was.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.150
I see. Show me, then.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.520
The records?

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:13.030
The inside of the storehouse. 
It will be quicker.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.900
That will be difficult.

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:20.080
Only the eunuchs who manage the 
storehouse and I are permitted entry.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.220
Just don't tell anyone, then.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:24.820
What's the matter?

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:27.710
Nothing. I thought he might 
have something to say about it.

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:30.260
Wei Qing isn't here today.

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:31.960
He's away running an errand.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:36.680
I see. It's unusual for him 
to leave your side.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.850
Regarding the storehouse, 
you should do as you please.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:43.810
I can't accompany you, but I'll make 
arrangements to allow you in.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:44.730
Are you sure?

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:49.160
They say the Raven Consort could 
have anything if so desired.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:52.480
Simply viewing the treasures in 
the storehouse should be trivial.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.840
Everything could be yours if you desired.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:00.490
Did you hear what he just said?

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.490
Hear what?

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:09.500
So, he did hear.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.270
The sorcerer?

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:29.280
Yes. I heard you know where he is.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:34.770
Do I? My memory isn't what it used to be.

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:36.580
Will this help you remember?

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:40.160
I think he may be in 
the red-light district.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:42.140
The red-light district?

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:47.160
Yeah. The previous dynasty 
apparently thought highly of him,

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.670
but Yandi drove all of them 
out of the palace.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:54.750
He must really resent the current emperor.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.670
Red-light District

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:03.090
Hey, wait up.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:08.770
What?

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:12.810
Sure, there's probably a sorcerer 
or two mixed in among us.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:35.000
What do you think this place is?

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.840
Lies are layered on top of other lies here.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.720
I'm aware.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:44.530
This is a waste of time. What am I doing?

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.730
Que Er?

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.530
Is that you, Que Er?

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.740
I knew it was you. Do you remember me?

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.380
Your mother and I—

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:02.000
Stay back! Stay back!

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:04.870
Hey! Wait a minute, Que Er!

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.610
<i>Que Er. That used to be my name.</i>

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:20.630
<i>My mother was the store's 
most beautiful entertainer.</i>

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.550
<i>My father was one of her best customers.</i>

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:28.470
<i>There was even talk of him buying her 
freedom and making her his mistress.</i>

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:34.060
<i>But perhaps my father never
 intended such things.</i>

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:38.480
<i>In the end, nothing came of it.</i>

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.910
<i>My mother died after stabbing 
herself in the throat with a razor.</i>

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:47.200
<i>The smell of powder, sweat, and
 the suffocating stench of blood...</i>

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:50.870
<i>That is my last memory of this place.</i>

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:55.960
<i>As a young child left all on his own, 
I had only two choices.</i>

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:58.740
<i>One was to become a male prostitute.</i>

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:02.460
<i>The other was to become a eunuch 
and enter the palace.</i>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.810
<i>I refused to become a prostitute,</i>

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:07.970
<i>so I chose to become a eunuch instead.</i>

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.260
Name?

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.470
My name is Que Er.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.600
Que Er? Cute name.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:21.370
<i>But my masters taught me that 
both choices were the same.</i>

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:25.660
<i>Unable to withstand the humiliation 
inflicted on me by the masters,</i>

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:27.610
<i>one night, I ran away.</i>

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:55.020
<i>I still remember the warmth of his hand.</i>

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:57.630
<i>I was covered in wounds,</i>

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:00.990
<i>but he asked no questions and instead 
sheltered me, appointing me his attendant.</i>

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:07.180
<i>Even now, my master has never 
once asked me about that time.</i>

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:15.290
<i>My master gave me both 
my surname and given name.</i>

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.740
<i>I abandoned my previous identiy.</i>

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:21.080
<i>I was reborn as a eunuch 
who protected his master.</i>

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.290
<i>At least, I thought I'd been.</i>

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:24.050
<i>But...</i>

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.550
Wait a minute, Que Er!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:30.550
Que Er? Cute name.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:32.300
Que Er.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.250
Master...

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:18.270
Master, what happened?

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.310
Excuse me.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:32.570
You're back.

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:37.830
I know you've only just returned, 
but I'd like you to do something for me.

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:41.760
Could you make some tea?

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:47.340
I'm sorry.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.750
I was unable to locate the sorcerer.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:53.090
Next time...

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:58.600
You've done enough. I'll have 
someone else handle it.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.720
But...

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:02.600
Where did this tea come from?

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.120
It's from Wuzhou.

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:06.280
It's good.

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:09.990
Whether it was tea or calligraphy, 
you picked it up quickly.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:14.250
It's because learning was so much fun.

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:18.790
It was something I'd never even 
hoped for, before you saved me.

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.370
Your tea is the best, after all.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.550
Master...

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.750
May I ask that you make more tomorrow?

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:32.660
Yes.

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:41.350
<i>My fate had tainted</i>

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:48.580
<i>The heavily falling snow black</i>

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:55.060
<i>The sun shines in gradually</i>

00:16:55.060 --> 00:17:02.240
<i>And freshly melts it away 
with its summer warmth</i>

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:09.000
<i>The dream you saw in your eternal sleep</i>

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:14.150
<i>I'll do whatever I can to make it come true</i>

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:16.700
<i>(I want to help you, it's true)</i>

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:22.690
<i>Because you made your wish to me</i>

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:29.760
<i>Just like the sun shining 
through the darkness</i>

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:35.330
<i>The bouquet of light</i>

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:43.780
<i>That you had given me</i>

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:52.470
<i>Still connects the seasons 
that will never meet</i>

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:56.810
<i>The proof of this pain</i>

00:17:56.810 --> 00:18:03.540
<i>Will it be able to stay the snow 
that falls in the summer?</i>

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:24.560
It's you.

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:27.210
Raven Consort, we need to talk.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.160
What is it?

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.670
It's true...

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.300
I am, in fact, a gloomy
 and unpleasant fellow.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.930
No, I'm sorry about the other day.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.140
You were correct.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:45.170
Because you were a eunuch 
and subordinate to me,

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:47.780
I assumed you wouldn't say such things.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:51.520
Despite claiming I don't 
care about courtesy,

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.570
it had become ingrained 
in the back of my mind.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:57.940
I'm the one who's unpleasant. I'm sorry.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:01.650
The Raven Consort truly is different.

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:05.700
No consort would ever bow 
her head to a servant like a eunuch.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:08.710
It would seem you're not 
a true consort, after all.

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:11.210
You <i>are</i> an unpleasant man.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:17.090
What I wanted to discuss was the ghosts 
that appear in my master's bedchamber.

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:18.670
Ghosts?

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:21.210
Of Lady Xie Fei and Brother Ding.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:24.220
Brother Ding? You mean Ding Lan?

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.850
That's what I called him.

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.250
He was old enough to be my father,

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.100
but he said he preferred it 
because it was less stuffy.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:36.360
His mother and Ding Lan are ghosts?

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:46.850
They began appearing to him 
over the past month.

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:49.980
They apparently don't harm him,

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.370
but my master is increasingly 
exhausted day by day.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.200
Why didn't you tell me?

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:57.510
Because he told me not to.

00:19:57.510 --> 00:20:00.880
I see. You must be desperate.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:03.030
What is it?

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:07.390
Nothing. I was expecting a crueler answer.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:10.390
Who do you think I am?

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:12.420
Forgive me.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:17.630
There's something else I'd like to say 
to avoid misunderstandings.

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:23.910
I may come to regret 
turning to you for help.

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:28.890
But depending on how it is used,

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:31.910
a poison can become a medicine for healing.

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:34.740
My master is suffering.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.940
Please, help him.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:43.930
Having someone like you at 
his side must make him happy.

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:45.820
Very well.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.680
Ningguang Hall

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:50.510
This smell...

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:52.610
Do you smell something?

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:55.540
Wen Ying, is his bedchamber that way?

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:56.600
Yes.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:00.360
This will require some clever planning.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:01.640
Clever planning?

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:04.640
I'm going to deal with the 
storehouse first. Where is it?

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:06.990
I see. This way.

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:11.240
You must be the Raven Consort.

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:13.960
I have been waiting for you.

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.710
I am Yuyi.

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.900
Yuyi is your official title as one 
who manages the storehouse.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:21.460
What is your name?

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.590
I don't have one.

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:26.960
Please call me Yuyi.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.220
Yuyi

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:28.470
Very well.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.600
I'll be waiting here.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:40.600
All right.

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:46.540
Please wait here.

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:55.870
What's this?

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:20.120
<i>I shall play the best role of all</i>

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:26.790
<i>The saddest role where one kills the most</i>

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:33.880
<i>Even at the ends of this square ocean, 
people change and are replaced</i>

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:39.870
<i>You forget that you're 
playing a role in this world</i>

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:43.240
<i>Everyone is just a bird in a cage</i>

00:22:43.240 --> 00:22:46.920
<i>We all look forward to the day we can escape</i>

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:50.130
<i>And once it's within our grasp</i>

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:53.270
<i>The great big sky overwhelms us</i>

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:57.790
<i>MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:22:57.790 --> 00:23:03.830
<i>Call out the name and bring calm</i>

00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:13.830
<i>No one can stop your MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:22.260
<i>My MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:32.930
<i>Now, I shall play the best role of all</i>

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:35.010
Raven of the Inner Palace

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Episode 6</b>

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>The Summer King and the Winter King</b>
